"National Dhaba is another of Bandra’s timeless legends, located close to Bandra Station. This spot serves some of the best Punjabi dishes in the area — hearty, flavourful, and easy on the pocket. Their chaas and limbu paani make perfect companions to the meal, and the menu is filled with comforting classics. My personal favourites are the Rajma and Paneer Bhurji, best enjoyed with their crispy tandoori rotis."🥚🥘

